.TH "JSONKIT\-COMPLETION\-UNINSTALL" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-completion\-uninstall \- Remove completion from your shell.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit completion uninstall\fR [shell] [options]
.fi
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
\fIshell\fR
The shell: bash, zsh, fish, pwsh, or nu. Every installed shell when left out. One of: bash, zsh, fish, pwsh, nu.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-completion\fR(1)
